<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>컨택센터 관리자 대시보드</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pretendard:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <style>
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'Pretendard';
            src: url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard/dist/web/static/pretendard.css');
        }

        :root {
            --bg-color: #0f172a;
            --bg-primary: #0f172a;
            --bg-secondary: #1e293b;
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --card-bg-hover: #334155;
            --text-primary: #f8fafc;
            --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
            --border-color: #334155;
            --primary-blue: #3b82f6;
            --primary-light: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
            --accent-indigo: #6366f1;
            --accent-purple: #8b5cf6;
            --accent-pink: #ec4899;
            --accent-red: #ef4444;
            --danger-red: #ef4444;
            --accent-orange: #f97316;
            --warning-orange: #f59e0b;
            --accent-yellow: #eab308;
            --accent-green: #10b981;
            --success-green: #10b981;
            --accent-teal: #14b8a6;
            --accent-cyan: #06b6d4;
            --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.3);
            --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.3);
            --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            min-height: 100vh;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .dashboard {
            max-width: 1600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 24px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 24px;
        }

        /* Header */
        .header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 16px 24px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
            animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        .header-left {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-blue), var(--accent-purple));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .header-badge {
            padding: 6px 12px;
            background: var(--primary-light);
            border: 1px solid var(--primary-blue);
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--primary-blue);
        }

        .header-actions {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .date-badge {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .refresh-btn {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-blue), var(--accent-indigo));
            border: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: white;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .refresh-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
        }

        /* KPI Cards */
        .kpi-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .kpi-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            animation: slideUp 0.5s ease forwards;
            opacity: 0;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .kpi-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 2px;
        }

        .kpi-card:nth-child(1)::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-blue), var(--accent-cyan)); }
        .kpi-card:nth-child(2)::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--danger-red), var(--accent-orange)); }
        .kpi-card:nth-child(3)::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-teal), var(--accent-green)); }
        .kpi-card:nth-child(4)::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-purple), var(--accent-pink)); }

        .kpi-card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
        .kpi-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
        .kpi-card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
        .kpi-card:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.25s; }

        @keyframes slideUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        .kpi-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            border-color: var(--primary-blue);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
        }

        .kpi-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .kpi-icon {
            width: 28px;
            height: 28px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .kpi-card:nth-child(1) .kpi-icon { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15); }
        .kpi-card:nth-child(2) .kpi-icon { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15); }
        .kpi-card:nth-child(3) .kpi-icon { background: rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.15); }
        .kpi-card:nth-child(4) .kpi-icon { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15); }

        .kpi-label {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .kpi-value {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }

        .kpi-card:nth-child(1) .kpi-value { color: var(--primary-blue); }
        .kpi-card:nth-child(2) .kpi-value { color: var(--danger-red); }
        .kpi-card:nth-child(3) .kpi-value { color: var(--accent-teal); }
        .kpi-card:nth-child(4) .kpi-value { color: var(--accent-purple); }

        .kpi-change {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 3px;
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .kpi-change.positive { color: var(--success-green); }
        .kpi-change.negative { color: var(--danger-red); }

        /* Chart Grid */
        .chart-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 16px;
        }

        /* Cards */
        .card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            animation: slideUp 0.6s ease forwards;
            opacity: 0;
        }

        .card:hover {
            border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
        }

        .card-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .card-title-icon {
            width: 26px;
            height: 26px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            background: var(--primary-light);
        }

        .card-menu {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .card-menu-btn {
            width: 26px;
            height: 26px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .card-menu-btn:hover {
            background: var(--primary-light);
            color: var(--primary-blue);
            border-color: var(--primary-blue);
        }

        /* Chart Container */
        .chart-container {
            position: relative;
            height: 200px;
            padding: 8px;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5);
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        /* Animation delays */
        .chart-grid .card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
        .chart-grid .card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.35s; }
        .chart-grid .card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
        .chart-grid .card:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.45s; }
        .chart-grid .card:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
        .chart-grid .card:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.55s; }

        /* Customer Table */
        .table-card {
            animation-delay: 0.5s;
        }

        .table-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .table-filters {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .filter-btn {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            font-family: inherit;
        }

        .filter-btn:hover, .filter-btn.active {
            background: var(--primary-light);
            border-color: var(--primary-blue);
            color: var(--primary-blue);
        }

        .search-input {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            width: 240px;
            font-family: inherit;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .search-input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--primary-blue);
            background: var(--bg-primary);
        }

        .search-input::placeholder {
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .customer-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        .customer-table th {
            text-align: left;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5);
        }

        .customer-table th:first-child {
            border-radius: 8px 0 0 0;
        }

        .customer-table th:last-child {
            border-radius: 0 8px 0 0;
        }

        .customer-table td {
            padding: 14px 16px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .customer-table tbody tr {
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .customer-table tbody tr:hover {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.05);
        }

        .customer-table tbody tr:hover td {
            color: var(--primary-blue);
        }

        .customer-id {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--primary-blue);
        }

        .customer-name {
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .risk-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .risk-badge.high {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
            color: var(--danger-red);
            border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
        }

        .risk-badge.medium {
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
            color: var(--warning-orange);
            border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
        }

        .risk-badge.low {
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
            color: var(--success-green);
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
        }

        .issue-badge {
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .issue-badge.billing { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15); color: var(--primary-blue); }
        .issue-badge.quality { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15); color: var(--accent-purple); }
        .issue-badge.churn { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15); color: var(--danger-red); }
        .issue-badge.fault { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); color: var(--warning-orange); }

        .contact-count {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
        }

        .contact-dot {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent-purple);
        }

        /* Pagination */
        .table-pagination {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 16px;
            padding-top: 16px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .pagination-info {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .pagination-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .page-btn {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            font-family: inherit;
        }

        .page-btn:hover, .page-btn.active {
            background: var(--primary-blue);
            border-color: var(--primary-blue);
            color: white;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 1400px) {
            .chart-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .chart-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .kpi-row {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }

            .dashboard {
                padding: 16px;
                gap: 16px;
            }

            .header {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 16px;
            }

            .table-filters {
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }
        }

        /* Loading State */
        .loading {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 200px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .spinner {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border: 3px solid var(--border-color);
            border-top-color: var(--primary-blue);
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        /* Tooltip */
        .chart-tooltip {
            background: var(--card-bg) !important;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color) !important;
            border-radius: 8px !important;
            color: var(--text-primary) !important;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg) !important;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="dashboard">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="header">
        <div class="header-left">
            <h1>📊 컨택센터 관리자 대시보드</h1>
            <span class="header-badge">실시간 모니터링</span>
        </div>
        <div class="header-actions">
            <div class="date-badge">
                📅 <span id="currentDate"></span>
            </div>
            <button class="refresh-btn" onclick="refreshData()">
                🔄
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- KPI Cards -->
    <div class="kpi-row">
        <div class="kpi-card">
            <div class="kpi-header">
                <div class="kpi-icon">👥</div>
                <span class="kpi-change positive" id="totalCustomersChange">↑ 2.3%</span>
            </div>
            <span class="kpi-label">총 고객 수</span>
            <span class="kpi-value" id="totalCustomers">-</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi-card">
            <div class="kpi-header">
                <div class="kpi-icon">🚨</div>
                <span class="kpi-change negative" id="riskCustomersChange">↑ 5명</span>
            </div>
            <span class="kpi-label">이탈 위험 고객</span>
            <span class="kpi-value" id="riskCustomers">-</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi-card">
            <div class="kpi-header">
                <div class="kpi-icon">⏱️</div>
                <span class="kpi-change positive" id="avgWaitChange">↓ 12%</span>
            </div>
            <span class="kpi-label">평균 대기 시간</span>
            <span class="kpi-value" id="avgWaitTime">-</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi-card">
            <div class="kpi-header">
                <div class="kpi-icon">🔄</div>
                <span class="kpi-change negative" id="repeatRateChange">↑ 3.2%</span>
            </div>
            <span class="kpi-label">반복 문의율</span>
            <span class="kpi-value" id="repeatRate">-</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Chart Grid -->
    <div class="chart-grid">
        <!-- Issue Category Donut Chart -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">
                <h3 class="card-title">
                    <span class="card-title-icon">📊</span>
                    문의 카테고리 분포
                </h3>
                <div class="card-menu">
                    <button class="card-menu-btn">⋮</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="chart-container">
                <canvas id="categoryChart"></canvas>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Churn Probability Histogram -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">
                <h3 class="card-title">
                    <span class="card-title-icon">📈</span>
                    이탈 확률 분포
                </h3>
                <div class="card-menu">
                    <button class="card-menu-btn">⋮</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="chart-container">
                <canvas id="churnHistogram"></canvas>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Repeat Contacts vs Churn Probability Scatter -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">
                <h3 class="card-title">
                    <span class="card-title-icon">🔴</span>
                    반복문의 vs 이탈확률
                </h3>
                <div class="card-menu">
                    <button class="card-menu-btn">⋮</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="chart-container">
                <canvas id="scatterChart"></canvas>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Contract Type Churn Rate Bar Chart -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">
                <h3 class="card-title">
                    <span class="card-title-icon">📊</span>
                    계약유형별 이탈률
                </h3>
                <div class="card-menu">
                    <button class="card-menu-btn">⋮</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="chart-container">
                <canvas id="contractChart"></canvas>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Wait Time Distribution Histogram -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">
                <h3 class="card-title">
                    <span class="card-title-icon">⏱️</span>
                    대기 시간 분포
                </h3>
                <div class="card-menu">
                    <button class="card-menu-btn">⋮</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="chart-container">
                <canvas id="waitTimeChart"></canvas>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Call Duration Distribution Histogram -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">
                <h3 class="card-title">
                    <span class="card-title-icon">📞</span>
                    통화 시간 분포
                </h3>
                <div class="card-menu">
                    <button class="card-menu-btn">⋮</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="chart-container">
                <canvas id="callDurationChart"></canvas>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Customer Risk Table -->
    <div class="card table-card">
        <div class="card-header">
            <h3 class="card-title">
                <span class="card-title-icon">🚨</span>
                이탈 위험 고객 리스트
            </h3>
            <div class="table-filters">
                <button class="filter-btn active" onclick="filterRisk('all')">전체</button>
                <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterRisk('high')">고위험</button>
                <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterRisk('medium')">중위험</button>
                <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterRisk('low')">저위험</button>
                <input type="text" class="search-input" placeholder="🔍 고객 검색..." id="customerSearchInput" oninput="searchCustomers()">
            </div>
        </div>
        <table class="customer-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>고객 ID</th>
                    <th>고객명</th>
                    <th>이탈 확률</th>
                    <th>문의 유형</th>
                    <th>반복 문의</th>
